  "Click to cycle: All → Within □ → Across □\nWithin: endpoints share an innermost □. Across: different innermost □, or a □ to outside.\nOuter wrappers do not join separate inner □. Unframed links appear in All. Only visibility changes.": "点击切换：全部 → □ 内部 → 跨 □\n内部：两端位于同一个最内层 □。跨框：位于不同的最内层 □，或从 □ 连接到外部。\n外层框不合并独立的内层 □。无框连线在“全部”中显示。仅改变可见性。",
